  "scope": [
    "Pair relative Maxwell speeds and explicit common effective areas provide a sensitivity, not inferred mixture collision data.",
    "Uniform steady Maxwellian molecular wall flux remains n vbar/4 in the presence of gas-gas collisions. The corresponding globally uniform inventory balance therefore does not require a collisionless cavity.",
    "The spherical first-flight impulse response requires collisionless chords and is not an upper or lower bound when Kn is near or below unity. Collisions can change source peaks, angular focusing, and release-front relaxation.",
    "The routed g=.01 case has a nearly steady reservoir in the diffuse model; this does not bound localized fresh plumes or spatially segregated pumping.",
    "A full calculation would use species/state-dependent cross sections and the actual source/sink angular geometry in a kinetic transport solver."
  ],
